the tracked bd/.beads/dolt call-site census (runtime: 260 sites/34 files
-> 245 sites/32 files), which the release-readiness gate's
d20-audit-artifact-current check compares the checked-in artifact
against on every run. Regenerated via the project's own
auditBdCallSites()/renderBdCallSiteAuditMarkdown() (lib/release-readiness.js)
rather than hand-editing, so the artifact matches what forge release check
computes. Confirmed against CI logs (Unit Shard 2, Full Matrix macOS
Node 22) showing the same 4 failing tests, all in
test/commands/release.test.js / test/release-readiness*.test.js, with
the exact "artifact is not current: stale" blocker.
